{
  "id": "001-mansa-musa",
  "language": "en",
  "theme": "studio",
  "title": "The King Who Was So Rich He Crashed an Economy",
  "voice": {"name": "sterling", "model": "eleven_v3", "stability": 0.5, "seed": 21},
  "captions": {"landscape": false, "vertical": true},
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": "The richest man ever?",
      "say": "In 1324, one man walked into Cairo with so much gold... that he accidentally crashed the economy.",
      "layout": "left", "theme": "desert", "expression": "excited", "pose": "present", "look": {"x": 0.7, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"type": "year", "value": "1324", "word": 1}, {"type": "chart", "points": [10, 9.7, 8.4, 6.6, 5.6, 5.2], "label": "Value of gold", "word": 14}],
      "beats": [{"word": 10, "coin": true, "pose": "coin"}, {"word": 14, "expression": "surprised", "pose": "shrug"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "His name was Mansa Musa... and he may have been the richest person who ever lived.",
      "expression": "smug", "pose": "explain", "look": {"x": 0.6, "y": 0},
      "bigText": "Mansa Musa", "bigTextWord": 3,
      "props": [{"icon": "crown", "word": 3}, {"icon": "money-bag", "word": 11}]
    },
    {
      "say": "Hi, I'm Sterling, and today we're finding out how being too rich can actually break an economy.",
      "layout": "center", "theme": "studio", "expression": "happy", "pose": "wave", "hop": true, "look": {"x": 0, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "money-bag", "word": 11}, {"icon": "chart-decreasing", "word": 14}],
      "beats": [{"word": 4, "pose": "explainBoth", "expression": "excited"}]
    },
    {
      "chapter": "The Mali Empire",
      "say": "Let's go back seven hundred years, to West Africa.",
      "layout": "left", "theme": "parchment", "expression": "happy", "pose": "present", "look": {"x": 0.7, "y": -0.1},
      "bigText": "700 years ago", "bigTextWord": 3,
      "props": [{"icon": "globe-showing-europe-africa", "word": 7, "anim": "spin"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "Mansa Musa ruled the Mali Empire, which stretched from the Atlantic coast far into the interior of West Africa.",
      "expression": "neutral", "pose": "explain",
      "props": [{"icon": "classical-building", "word": 4, "label": "Mali Empire"}, {"icon": "world-map", "word": 10}]
    },
    {
      "say": "And Mali had something the whole world wanted... gold. Lots and lots of gold.",
      "theme": "vault", "expression": "smug", "pose": "explain",
      "bigText": "Gold", "bigTextWord": 8,
      "props": [{"icon": "coin", "word": 8, "anim": "drop"}, {"icon": "money-bag", "word": 11, "anim": "drop"}],
      "beats": [{"word": 8, "coin": true, "pose": "coin", "expression": "excited"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "Its mines were among the richest in the world, and Mali's gold flowed across the Sahara to North Africa, Europe and the Middle East.",
      "layout": "right", "expression": "neutral", "pose": "presentLeft", "look": {"x": -0.7, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "pick", "word": 1}, {"icon": "two-hump-camel", "word": 15, "anim": "slide"}, {"icon": "world-map", "word": 17}]
    },
    {
      "chapter": "The legendary journey",
      "say": "So in 1324, when Mansa Musa set off on the pilgrimage to Mecca... he did not exactly pack light.",
      "layout": "left", "theme": "desert", "expression": "happy", "pose": "present", "look": {"x": 0.7, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"type": "year", "value": "1324", "word": 2}, {"icon": "kaaba", "word": 12}],
      "beats": [{"word": 13, "expression": "smug", "pose": "hips", "look": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}]
    },
    {
      "say": "Chroniclers described an enormous caravan, by some accounts tens of thousands of people, and camels loaded with gold.",
      "expression": "surprised", "pose": "explain", "look": {"x": 0.6, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "camel", "word": 4, "anim": "slide"}, {"type": "stat", "value": "60,000?", "label": "people (some accounts)", "word": 8}, {"icon": "two-hump-camel", "word": 14, "anim": "slide"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "When he reached Cairo, Mansa Musa did what any extremely generous billionaire would do.",
      "layout": "closeup", "expression": "smug", "pose": "hips", "look": {"x": -0.5, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "mosque", "word": 3, "label": "Cairo"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "He spent gold. He gave gold away. To officials, to the poor, to pretty much everyone he met.",
      "layout": "left", "theme": "vault", "expression": "excited", "pose": "explain", "look": {"x": 0.6, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "coin", "word": 2, "anim": "drop"}, {"icon": "money-with-wings", "word": 5}, {"icon": "money-bag", "word": 8, "anim": "drop"}],
      "beats": [{"word": 2, "coin": true, "pose": "coin"}, {"word": 12, "pose": "explainBoth", "expression": "laugh"}]
    },
    {
      "chapter": "Why it went wrong",
      "say": "[whispers] And that's when things started to go wrong.",
      "layout": "center", "theme": "crimson", "expression": "worried", "pose": "shrug", "look": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "zoom": 1.08,
      "bigText": "Uh-oh.", "bigTextWord": 6
    },
    {
      "say": "Suddenly, Cairo was flooded with gold.",
      "layout": "left", "expression": "surprised", "pose": "present", "look": {"x": 0.7, "y": -0.3},
      "props": [{"icon": "coin", "word": 3, "anim": "drop"}, {"icon": "coin", "word": 4, "anim": "drop"}, {"icon": "money-bag", "word": 5, "anim": "drop"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "And here's the rule that runs every economy on Earth: when something becomes common, it becomes less valuable.",
      "layout": "center", "theme": "studio", "expression": "determined", "pose": "explainBoth", "look": {"x": 0, "y": 0},
      "bigText": "Common = cheap", "bigTextWord": 13,
      "props": [{"icon": "balance-scale", "word": 3}],
      "beats": [{"word": 10, "coin": true, "pose": "coin", "expression": "excited"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "If everyone has gold, gold stops being special. So merchants started asking for more of it, for the exact same things.",
      "layout": "left", "expression": "neutral", "pose": "explain", "look": {"x": 0.6, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "coin", "word": 3}, {"icon": "bread", "word": 9}, {"icon": "chart-increasing", "word": 13, "label": "Prices"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "Prices went up. Each piece of gold bought less. Economists have a name for this: inflation.",
      "expression": "determined", "pose": "present", "look": {"x": 0.7, "y": 0},
      "bigText": "Inflation", "bigTextWord": 15,
      "props": [{"type": "chart", "points": [2, 2.4, 3.4, 5, 6.6, 8], "label": "Prices", "word": 0}, {"type": "chart", "points": [8, 7.2, 5.6, 4.2, 3.3, 3], "label": "Gold's value", "word": 3}]
    },
    {
      "chapter": "The aftermath",
      "say": "And it didn't bounce back quickly. The historian al-Umari, writing about twelve years later, reported that gold in Cairo still hadn't recovered its value.",
      "layout": "right", "theme": "parchment", "expression": "neutral", "pose": "presentLeft", "look": {"x": -0.7, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "scroll", "word": 7}, {"type": "stat", "value": "12 years", "label": "later: still low", "word": 11}, {"icon": "hourglass-not-done", "word": 19}]
    },
    {
      "say": "[laughs] One man's shopping trip shook the gold market of an entire region.",
      "layout": "left", "expression": "laugh", "pose": "shrug", "look": {"x": 0.3, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "shopping-cart", "word": 2}, {"icon": "globe-showing-europe-africa", "word": 9}]
    },
    {
      "chapter": "Gold on the map",
      "say": "His fame spread all the way to Europe. On a famous map from 1375, the Catalan Atlas, Mansa Musa is drawn on a throne, holding a golden nugget.",
      "expression": "happy", "pose": "present", "look": {"x": 0.7, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "world-map", "word": 11}, {"type": "year", "value": "1375", "word": 13}, {"icon": "crown", "word": 23}],
      "beats": [{"word": 26, "coin": true, "pose": "coin", "expression": "excited"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "But Mansa Musa wasn't just a big spender. Back home, he built mosques, and helped make Timbuktu a famous center of learning.",
      "layout": "right", "theme": "desert", "expression": "neutral", "pose": "presentLeft", "look": {"x": -0.7, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "mosque", "word": 11}, {"icon": "books", "word": 16, "label": "Timbuktu"}]
    },
    {
      "chapter": "The lesson",
      "say": "So what's the lesson here? Money is only valuable because it's scarce.",
      "layout": "center", "theme": "studio", "expression": "thinking", "pose": "think", "look": {"x": 0, "y": -0.4},
      "bigText": "Scarcity", "bigTextWord": 11,
      "props": [{"icon": "gem-stone", "word": 8}],
      "beats": [{"word": 5, "coin": true, "pose": "coin", "expression": "determined", "look": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}]
    },
    {
      "say": "Flood the market with gold, or print too much money, and every coin buys a little less.",
      "layout": "left", "expression": "neutral", "pose": "explain", "look": {"x": 0.6, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"icon": "printer", "word": 6}, {"icon": "dollar-banknote", "word": 9}, {"type": "chart", "points": [9, 8.2, 6.4, 4.8, 3.7, 3.2], "label": "Buying power", "word": 11}]
    },
    {
      "say": "That's exactly what happened in Germany in 1923, and in Zimbabwe in 2008. But those are stories for another video.",
      "theme": "crimson", "expression": "worried", "pose": "present", "look": {"x": 0.7, "y": 0},
      "props": [{"type": "year", "value": "1923", "word": 7}, {"type": "year", "value": "2008", "word": 12}],
      "beats": [{"word": 13, "expression": "wink", "pose": "explain"}]
    },
    {
      "say": "If you want to know how money really works, subscribe. And tell me in the comments: what money mystery should I solve next?",
      "layout": "left", "theme": "studio", "expression": "happy", "pose": "explain", "subscribe": true, "look": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0},
      "beats": [{"word": 9, "pose": "point"}, {"word": 16, "expression": "thinking", "pose": "think", "look": {"x": 0.3, "y": -0.5}}, {"word": 22, "expression": "wink", "pose": "wave", "look": {"x": 0, "y": 0}}]
    }
  ],
